# Pilot results

Canonical evidence: `docs/pilot/results/<GATE-ID>/` (`INDEX.md` + `<issue#>-<slug>.md`). GitHub issues = status/checklists + short link comment — not the archive. Do not mark pilot **pass** in `ABYSS_FIRST_CASES.md` / `TEST_PLAN.md` without a phase file (or linked logs). Bug/live-fail: prove ×2 (`bug-prove-twice.mdc`).

Before a phase: read prior phase **Inputs** via `INDEX.md`; follow `docs/pilot/PILOT-GATE-*.md`. Finish: write/update phase file (Meta, Inputs, Evidence, Conclusion, Checklist), update `INDEX.md`, comment the link on the issue. Layout: `docs/pilot/results/README.md`.
